  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program formulation of Danish support to the African Water Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Department for Sustainable Investments, Jobs and Equal Opportunities (GJL) is seeking a consultant to support to formulation of new Danish support to the African Water Facility. The overall objective of the consultancy covering a period of January to June 2021 is to finalize a draft concept note including all required annexes and develop, in close collaboration with AWF and MFA, a programme document and all required annexes in a final format ultimately ready for approval by the Danida Programme Committee, Council for Development Policy and the Minister, according to the Danida AMG for programmes above 39 DKK millions.</narrative>
  </description>
